                "normalized_text_sha256": "de6fcf6e2f04834cef50fff8b90a4cfcf5ebe74f6930c75b84100b3cc2012f57"
            },
            "text": "R: Good afternoon, welcome to the Grand Serenata Hotel. How may I help you?\nG: Hi, I have a reservation under the name David Chen.\nR: Thank you, Mr. Chen. Let me just find that for you. May I see your passport, please?\nG: Sure, here you go.\nR: Thank you. I have you in a Deluxe Room for two nights, checking out on Friday. Is that correct?\nG: Yes, that is right.\nR: Wonderful. We also take a small deposit at check-in, which is fully refunded when you leave. Is that alright?\nG: No problem.\nR: Thank you. Here is your key card. Your room is 305, on the third floor. Breakfast is from 7 to 10 in the morning, and the Wi-Fi details are on this card.\nG: Perfect. Is there a lift?\nR: Yes, it is just around the corner to your left. Is there anything else I can help you with?\nG: No, that is all. Thank you.\nR: Enjoy your stay, Mr. Chen. We are happy to have you.",
            "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
            "id": "37409c77-5d50-523f-8cb7-4e5f467933a9",
